  <History Date="11-03-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Fixed Iris locate (wheel direction)." Version="2" />
  <History Date="09-12-21" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added product thumbnail and gobo and colour swatches, highlight/lowlight and palettes based on the Showtec Expression 8000 Spot in response to customer feedback (not documented).  Note Showtec documentation doesn't detail gobo order." Version="3" />
